OL,3,AFamily pay tribute to 'ray of sunshine'
OL,4,Adaughter killed by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement released through Police
OL,7,FScotland her family said Sophia was
OL,8,F"loved by everyone who knew her",
OL,9,Fadding that "a light has gone out, and
OL,10,Fit will never return."
